cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these records or scripts, please cite the paper below and this repository."
title: "Replication of The Price of Failure Risk: Clipped Barrier Policy Gradients with Convex Regularization"
type: dataset
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Replication repository of the paper The Price of Failure Risk: Clipped Barrier Policy Gradients with Convex
  Regularization, checked against revision 73 of the paper. It holds every study's simulator, training and analysis
  scripts, the protocols fixed before each campaign, and the records of every run, so that each table and figure of
  the paper can be regenerated from the records and each campaign can be run again. The studies are the
  wear-allowance asset, the fuel-tank controller, the solvable flow and a Safety-Gymnasium navigation task. The
  records are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-records.md) and the code under MIT (LICENSE). The toolbox for
  applying the method to new problems is barrierpg (https://github.com/pma-papers/barrierpg).
repository-code: "https://github.com/pma-papers/bpg-replication"
